config DEMO_APP_MUSE_SETUP_TEST
    bool "Muse Setup Test"
    depends on BT_MUSE_SETUP_SERVICE
    help
      Opens the Muse gadget setup window from the watch and shows what the
      second, private link does (discovery, connection, identity, MTU,
      writes echoed back), for checking it with a generic BLE app before the
      companion app relays the setup.
